.','/assets/editorial/blog--best-place-to-sell-books-online-shopify-vs-marketplaces-(2026).webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "Understand where readers will come from"], ["section-2", "Compare proceeds with like-for-like costs"], ["section-3", "Check exclusivity before selling direct"], ["section-4", "Build a reader-friendly package"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','3');
