.
Published by BIG Digital Downloads. This is an editorial guide, not an independent benchmark. A feature absent from a listing is treated as not stated, not automatically unavailable.','/assets/editorial/blog--big-digital-downloads-vs-fileflare.io.webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "A small protected catalogue"], ["section-2", "A large library or video business"], ["section-3", "Developer requirements matter"], ["section-4", "Avoid comparing the wrong plan names"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','7');
