or
[prepare your next launch with the free tools](https://www.bigdigitaldownload.com/tools)
.','/assets/editorial/blog--electronic-software-distribution-(esd)-on-shopify-complete-guide.webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "Keep delivery and activation separate"], ["section-2", "Package for the supported environment"], ["section-3", "Design an update policy before selling"], ["section-4", "Track exceptions"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','12');
