or
[prepare your next launch with the free tools](https://www.bigdigitaldownload.com/tools)
.','/assets/editorial/blog--how-to-bundle-upsell-digital-products-shopify.webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "Build around a job, not a file count"], ["section-2", "Make the price comparison honest"], ["section-3", "Map every component to delivery"], ["section-4", "Keep upsells optional and relevant"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','13');
