or
[prepare your next launch with the free tools](https://www.bigdigitaldownload.com/tools)
.','/assets/editorial/blog--how-to-create-a-digital-product-from-scratch-(2026-step-by-step-guide).webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "Define the outcome"], ["section-2", "Create the smallest useful version"], ["section-3", "Get feedback from the intended buyer"], ["section-4", "Launch a clear offer"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','14');
