or
[prepare your next launch with the free tools](https://www.bigdigitaldownload.com/tools)
.','/assets/editorial/blog--how-to-protect-digital-products-from-piracy-on-shopify-(5-layers).webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "Layers 1 and 2: clear rights and controlled access"], ["section-2", "Layer 3: reasonable download limits"], ["section-3", "Layer 4: PDF stamping"], ["section-4", "Layer 5: an incident response"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','17');
