.','/assets/editorial/blog--how-to-sell-world-cup-canva-templates-on-shopify.webp','The BIG team','2026-09-22','3','[["section-1", "Remove stale event promises"], ["section-2", "Check two separate sets of rights"], ["section-3", "Deliver the editable template safely"], ["section-4", "Design for reuse"], ["action-plan", "Your practical action plan"], ["before-launch", "Before you publish"]]','published','30');
